From: DjDeveloperr <hey@djdev.me>
Subject: [PATCH] hk: preserve NIR library build mode in sampler bias tests

Read the NIR headers with the library's NDEBUG setting before enabling the
standalone test's assertions. Otherwise release tests reference validation
symbols omitted from the release NIR library, including through inline helpers.

Signed-off-by: DjDeveloperr <hey@djdev.me>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
--- a/src/asahi/vulkan/tests/test-hk-sampler-bias.c
+++ b/src/asahi/vulkan/tests/test-hk-sampler-bias.c
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT */
-#undef NDEBUG
 #include "hk_nir_sampler_bias.h"
 #include "asahi/compiler/agx_nir_texture.h"
 #include "compiler/glsl_types.h"
+#undef NDEBUG
+#include <assert.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
 
 static const nir_shader_compiler_options options = {0};
